{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a new intern. Your job: craft rubber ducks and feed them to a bottomless corporate pit.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/extras/ed00bc7cb92f35307b2b9b3f8bee5167.poster.avif?t=1762449843\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/extras/ed00bc7cb92f35307b2b9b3f8bee5167.webm?t=1762449843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/extras/ed00bc7cb92f35307b2b9b3f8bee5167.mp4?t=1762449843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Maw is always hungry. Start with ducks.<br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/extras/8fa44aac363e32d6663b8ea71b971ca8.poster.avif?t=1762449843\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/extras/8fa44aac363e32d6663b8ea71b971ca8.webm?t=1762449843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/extras/8fa44aac363e32d6663b8ea71b971ca8.mp4?t=1762449843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress to other unique items and better tools. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/extras/308389ea137e97225760ac7eb452cca9.poster.avif?t=1762449843\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/extras/308389ea137e97225760ac7eb452cca9.webm?t=1762449843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/extras/308389ea137e97225760ac7eb452cca9.mp4?t=1762449843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eventually assemble items to satisfy its appetite. <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/extras/9b914d24a9f97786098a5e4550e17f92.poster.avif?t=1762449843\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/extras/9b914d24a9f97786098a5e4550e17f92.webm?t=1762449843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/extras/9b914d24a9f97786098a5e4550e17f92.mp4?t=1762449843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BRUTALIST PSX AESTHETIC</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low-poly concrete vibe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harsh industrial lightning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corporate safety posters with increasing desperation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the Maw grow larger with each feeding phase.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock tools to be more efficient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > WHAT MAKES THIS DIFFERENT</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person physics sandbox with some progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete experience: 2-4 hours from intern to pit expert.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corporate satire without being preachy - the environment tells the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo dev passion project.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying combo system with escalating audio and visual feedback.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PSX/retro brutalist ae